  - name: Idle Min
    detail: Checks for minimum CPU Idle below a 5% threshold for 80% of metrics
    fluxfile: flux/usage_idle.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 8
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 600
    target: postfix
    action: | 
              This alert indicates and unusual and extended period during which the affected VM saw very low CPU Idle time. 
              It does not indicate the CPU activity, only unusual load. Use Influx/Grafana dashboards or Azure metrics to 
              investigate the type of CPU usage and log into the VM to look for top or iotop processes that may be malfunctioning. 